# A `vercel deploy` from a laptop uploads the working tree. Without this file it
# would carry the local .env files (dev secrets, read by `next build`) and a
# multi-GB .next into a production deployment (D-257). Git deploys never see
# untracked files; this only governs the CLI path.
.env*
!.env.example
**/.next
**/node_modules
test-results
playwright-report
